{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Genkai: Primal Awakening",
    "steam_appid": 2650340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/3a1fd519dd00177f6b7ceab639663c72.avif?t=1754154207\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine tactics and strategy in this roguelike deckbuilder, where you must build your deck, train and evolve your team. Step into a mystical world where the Genkai battle in a quest for power and harmony, and prepare for the imminent arrival of the Primal Genkai.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/ed24f969803cd03998c646fd715b980f.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move using your action points each round , choose the best strategy to execute more efficient attacks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Point (AP)</strong> : Use your action points to move or attack, but be careful because you have a limited number of action points each round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning Matters</strong>: Flank enemies, stay out of your enemies\u2019 line of sight, and watch out for environmental hazards \u2014 Genkai need to keep moving constantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Phases</strong>: Enemies change tactics at low health, demanding adaptive strategies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/332139649fa49f503b344a16035ec3ab.poster.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/332139649fa49f503b344a16035ec3ab.webm?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/332139649fa49f503b344a16035ec3ab.mp4?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/dbc93b809e4a31afb7ce790bef8496f5.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault, Tank, Support. Each Genkai has a distinct role, making every Genkai feel unique and play a specific part in each match. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/6be50261183229feb0ccfcc185be57ee.poster.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/6be50261183229feb0ccfcc185be57ee.webm?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/6be50261183229feb0ccfcc185be57ee.mp4?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/8c81cc7d968f75b8c0ab9abc90ff1058.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ cards to mix and match , find the strategy that suits you best.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Starter Decks</strong>: Each deck features cards and strategies as different as they are unique \u2014 discover all the combinations with the Genkai to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergy Focus</strong>: Help your Genkai get the most out of each battle by using cards that further enhance their abilities \u2014 explore every move carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong>: Unlock better cards with each run, and earn unique and powerful cards by defeating each boss in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/09de6ce0a91bcd4bc25f412376836bdf.poster.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/09de6ce0a91bcd4bc25f412376836bdf.webm?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/09de6ce0a91bcd4bc25f412376836bdf.mp4?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/cc3e02199662082bdbe40d903c5be552.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genkai evolve during combat, gain experience to increase their power and evolve them into their final form.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat Customization</strong>: Gain XP to increase your Genkai\u2019s strength and HP \u2014 as well as the power of their abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve in combat</strong>: Once they reach a certain level, Genkai evolve into their final form. Will you reach max level before falling in battle? There\u2019s only one way to find out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/1a4b77ad61b1a8264c632bd2f77c5cf6.poster.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/1a4b77ad61b1a8264c632bd2f77c5cf6.webm?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/1a4b77ad61b1a8264c632bd2f77c5cf6.mp4?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/4b84e97f19aa64cda0a0e717f7ddd2e2.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Genkai with 2 unique abilities and 2 pool abilities. Discover\u00a0synergies between Genkai teams<strong>.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability Modifiers: Upgrade your skills and unleash their true power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Combos: Chain abilities between Genkai for devastating effects.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/3a1fd519dd00177f6b7ceab639663c72.avif?t=1754154207\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine tactics and strategy in this roguelike deckbuilder, where you must build your deck, train and evolve your team. Step into a mystical world where the Genkai battle in a quest for power and harmony, and prepare for the imminent arrival of the Primal Genkai.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/ed24f969803cd03998c646fd715b980f.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move using your action points each round , choose the best strategy to execute more efficient attacks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Point (AP)</strong> : Use your action points to move or attack, but be careful because you have a limited number of action points each round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning Matters</strong>: Flank enemies, stay out of your enemies\u2019 line of sight, and watch out for environmental hazards \u2014 Genkai need to keep moving constantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Phases</strong>: Enemies change tactics at low health, demanding adaptive strategies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/332139649fa49f503b344a16035ec3ab.poster.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/332139649fa49f503b344a16035ec3ab.webm?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/332139649fa49f503b344a16035ec3ab.mp4?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/dbc93b809e4a31afb7ce790bef8496f5.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault, Tank, Support. Each Genkai has a distinct role, making every Genkai feel unique and play a specific part in each match. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/6be50261183229feb0ccfcc185be57ee.poster.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/6be50261183229feb0ccfcc185be57ee.webm?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/6be50261183229feb0ccfcc185be57ee.mp4?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/8c81cc7d968f75b8c0ab9abc90ff1058.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ cards to mix and match , find the strategy that suits you best.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Starter Decks</strong>: Each deck features cards and strategies as different as they are unique \u2014 discover all the combinations with the Genkai to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergy Focus</strong>: Help your Genkai get the most out of each battle by using cards that further enhance their abilities \u2014 explore every move carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong>: Unlock better cards with each run, and earn unique and powerful cards by defeating each boss in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/09de6ce0a91bcd4bc25f412376836bdf.poster.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/09de6ce0a91bcd4bc25f412376836bdf.webm?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/09de6ce0a91bcd4bc25f412376836bdf.mp4?t=1754154207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650340/extras/cc3e02199662082bdbe40d903c5be552.avif?t=1754154207\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genkai evolve during combat, gain experience to increase their power and evolve them into their final form.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat Customization</strong>: Gain XP to increase your Genkai\u2019s strength and HP \u2014 as well as the power of their abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve in combat</strong>: Once they reach a certain level, Genkai evolve into their final form. Will you reach max level before falling in battle? There\u2019s only one way to find out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class